chx:Research a res:ResearchProject ; rdfs:label "Recognizing text in images for an advanced course: chapter 22 of the 3rd edition and today's Python"@en ;
    sen0414:methodology "Primary source first: the chapter's named concepts from the textbook ontology built over the published chapter. Then the official documentation for the current release and the PEPs the chapter's topics touch. Every source opened and read on 2026-10-01T12:00:00; every claim taken from text actually read; every behaviour executed under Python 3.14.4." ;
    res:hasResearchScope chx:Scope ; rdfs:member chx:P01, chx:P02, chx:P03, chx:P04, chx:P05, chx:P06, chx:P07, chx:P08, chx:P09, chx:P10, chx:P11, chx:P12, chx:P13, chx:P14, chx:P15, chx:P16 .
chx:Scope a res:ResearchScope ; res:hasResearchQuestion "What does chapter 22 of the 3rd edition teach about recognizing text in images with Tesseract, PyTesseract and NAPS2, which of its claims and programs still hold under Python 3.14.4 with current tools, and what must an advanced course add so that it matches current practice?" ; res:hasTimeWindow "Current as of 2026-10-01." .
